# Normalize line endings: store as LF in the repo, check out native.
# Kills the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" churn on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
# Upstream Electron/Chromium licence files must stay byte-identical to the
# release dist zip. * text=auto treats LICENSES.chromium.html as text (no NUL
# bytes) and strips its CR bytes on commit, so macOS would ship a different
# stream than the Linux/Windows packages electron-builder builds from its own
# download. -text alone is enough; do not "normalize" these.
build/licenses/** -text
